	• Look for keywords: “Fairness,” “Diversity,” “Security,” “Explain,” “Optimize,” “Policy,” “Seats,” “Emoji,” “Fix,” “Business/Enterprise,” “Inline,” “Duplicate,” “Metrics,” “Suggest,” “Next word,” “Internet,” “Manual,” “Feedback,” “Analytics,” “Code/Patterns/Docs,” “Free,” “Audit,” “Common.”
